there. i wait.\nM1: i tap the scrap twice on the table, then leave the label beside it. “i mark the edge with my finger,” i say, tapping the scrap twice on the bench. “the bend stays.” i tap the bench once on the label, then write “quiet” beside it. i lean against the wall and tap the scrap twice on the table, then write “i kept the label under the bench” beside it.\n\ni tap the scrap twice on the bench\nM2: i leave the belt under the bench. the scrap stays bent. i put the label under the bench. the others can keep the noise. i leave the belt open. the bend stays.\n\nIt is M3's turn. What do you do or say next?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n",
